# SQL scripts location (OneDrive)

The ERP SQL script tree was moved out of this repo for OneDrive sync and its own git remote:

- **Canonical path:** `C:\Users\talkt\OneDrive - Space Alloys USA\SQL`
- **GitHub:** https://github.com/David-Kirchner/SQL-ERP_2
- **Pointer in this repo:** `MEM\SQL\README.md` only
- **Former tree (removed):** tracked files under `E:\VFP\ERP_2\MEM\SQL\...`

When reading, editing, or adding SQL under Config / Create ERP_new / QBO / etc., use the OneDrive location / `SQL-ERP_2` repo. Do not recreate the old tree under `MEM\SQL` unless the user asks for a junction/symlink.

